{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026yb2XqBmDSR1795770876.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>向來是公認好戲之人的吳岱融，憑藉《巨輪II》、《隱門》等劇集的反派形象深入民心，演技實力無庸置疑。現實生活中，他與太太鍾淑慧（Lily）更是圈中的模範夫妻，二人育有一子吳政樺（Justin），完美遺傳了父母的優良基因。</p><p>日前，吳岱融在社交平台分享喜訊，興奮透露兒子Justin在現任職的公司工作僅一年左右，便獲頒發「傑出員工獎」，工作表現與實力備受肯定！吳岱融留言寫道：「你看他現任職的公司一年左右便發給他傑出員工獎，爸爸為你高興，為你驕傲，仔我愛你。繼續努力，真係好鬼死開心！」字裡行間完全難掩自豪及愛子之情。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9d211475-7155-4276-b131-7e90e5aec62d.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20263njAGPPefs1795770876.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3ff5acfc-ba10-4f71-b469-4342bf8ca423.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026KnDC6RhoIO1795770875.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>從吳岱融公開的相片可見，Justin身穿深藍色西裝褸配襯白Tee斯文上陣，在台上雙手接過獎狀，十分有型。據悉，Justin從英國院校畢業後，便投身電影電腦特技行業。不少網民看過相片後都紛紛留言，激讚Justin「又叻又靚仔」，與爸爸一樣優秀！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:23:55.750880+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":378,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T12:17:16.505136+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:15.861863+00:00","content_hash":"b397ed8bd0c0b2f39cea893c176912e03e36b34b8dae5a505852414e9efb91e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:23:55.750880+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}